#* {{quote-journal|en|date=2022-03-03|author=Geoff Lemon|title=Australia plunge into unknown as cricket’s resurrection in Pakistan continues|journal=w:The Guardian|url=https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2022/mar/04/australia-plunge-into-unknown-as-crickets-resurrection-in-pakistan-continues|passage=Two days before Australia’s first Test match in Pakistan since 1998, the centre-wicket practice at {{w|Rawalpindi Cricket Stadium}} that had been teeming with players saw their numbers dissipate through that spring afternoon. For a time {{w|Steve Smith (cricketer)|[Steve] Smith}} alternated batting with {{w|Usman Khawaja}}, facing {{w|Ashton Agar}}’s '''left-arm orthodox'''.}}

